L866: When no proxy is set in sandbox settings, the local proxy selects its upstream proxy from the first non-empty environment variable on the host in this order: `HTTPS_PROXY`, `HTTP_PROXY`, `ALL_PROXY`. Only `http://` and `https://` proxies are supported, not `socks5`.
